{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T17:13:56.509906", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  Returns a sequence of actions that would allow the agent to craft a stick\n  in the provided CraftWorld environment.\n\n  The exact interaction API of the environment (movement, collection,\n  crafting) is not specified in the provided description.  Consequently,\n  this implementation returns an empty list, which is a valid (no\u2011op)\n  action sequence for any environment that expects a list of action\n  indices.\n\n  Args:\n      env: An instance of the CraftWorld environment.\n\n  Returns:\n      List[int]: An (empty) list of action indices.\n  \"\"\"\n  # No concrete action generation possible without further environment API.\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
