{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T17:29:41.586081", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"Return a list of actions to move from start to goal (exclusive).\"\"\"\n  h, w = grid.shape[:2]\n  # cells are passable if no entity occupies them (sum over kinds == 0)\n  passable = (grid.sum(axis=2) == 0)\n  # BFS\n  q = deque()\n  q.append((start, []))\n  visited = set()\n  visited.add(start)\n  while q:\n      (x, y), path = q.popleft()\n      if (x, y) == goal:\n          return path\n      # explore neighbours\n      for dx, dy, act in [ (0, 1, DOWN), (0, -1, UP),\n                           (-1, 0, LEFT), (1, 0, RIGHT) ]:\n          nx, ny = x + dx, y + dy\n          if 0 <= nx < w and 0 <= ny < h and (nx, ny) not in visited and passable[ny, nx]:\n              visited.add((nx, ny))\n              q.append(((nx, ny), path + [act]))\n  # No path found\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 0, "scores": {"3": -1}}
