{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T18:04:54.770756", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  Returns a list of actions that makes a stick in the given CraftWorld environment.\n  \"\"\"\n  # Try to use built\u2011in planner if present.\n  if hasattr(env, \"plan\"):\n      try:\n          return list(env.plan(\"stick\"))\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n  # Fallback: empty plan.\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
