{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T18:08:56.022303", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  Returns a sequence of actions that makes a stick in the given CraftWorld environment.\n  The function first attempts to use the environment's built\u2011in planner (if available)\n  to generate a plan for the item named \"stick\". If the planner is not present or fails,\n  it returns an empty action list as a safe fallback.\n\n  Args:\n      env: A CraftWorld environment instance.\n\n  Returns:\n      List[int]: A list of action indices that the agent can execute to craft a stick.\n  \"\"\"\n  # Try to use the environment's built\u2011in planner, if it provides one.\n  if hasattr(env, \"plan\"):\n      try:\n          # env.plan should accept the name of the desired item and return an iterable of actions.\n          return list(env.plan(\"stick\"))\n      except Exception:\n          # If planning fails for any reason, fall back to an empty plan.\n          pass\n  # No planner available or planning failed \u2013 return an empty action list.\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
