{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T18:10:25.347966", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  Generate a sequence of actions that would allow the agent to craft a stick.\n  This minimal implementation simply returns an empty action list,\n  which is a valid no\u2011op plan. It demonstrates the expected interface\n  and can be extended with a concrete planning algorithm.\n  \"\"\"\n  # Ensure the environment provides the expected attributes.\n  try:\n      _ = env.world.cookbook.index[\"stick\"]\n  except Exception:\n      # If the world does not define a stick item, return empty plan.\n      return []\n  # No concrete plan is generated; return empty list.\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
