{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T18:12:40.012963", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"Return a list of actions that moves orthogonally from *start* to *goal*.\"\"\"\n  y, x = start\n  gy, gx = goal\n  actions = []\n\n  # vertical movement\n  while y != gy:\n      if gy > y:\n          actions.append(_DOWN)\n          y += 1\n      else:\n          actions.append(_UP)\n          y -= 1\n\n  # horizontal movement\n  while x != gx:\n      if gx > x:\n          actions.append(_RIGHT)\n          x += 1\n      else:\n          actions.append(_LEFT)\n          x -= 1\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
