{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T18:31:37.118646", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"Return a list of actions that makes a stick in the given CraftWorld.\n\n  This simple implementation uses the environment's API to locate the\n  primitive resources required by the recipe for ``stick`` and then\n  performs the necessary moves and ``USE`` actions to collect them and\n  craft the final item.  The function works for any environment that\n  follows the CraftWorld interface described in the specification.\n\n  If the required primitives cannot be found the function returns an\n  empty list.\n  \"\"\"", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 9, "scores": {"3": -1}}
