{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T19:12:07.899854", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"Return a list of actions that moves from *start* to *goal* using\n  simple Manhattan moves (ignores obstacles).\"\"\"\n  sx, sy = start\n  gx, gy = goal\n  actions = []\n\n  # move in x direction\n  while sx < gx:\n      actions.append(RIGHT)\n      sx += 1\n  while sx > gx:\n      actions.append(LEFT)\n      sx -= 1\n\n  # move in y direction\n  while sy < gy:\n      actions.append(DOWN)\n      sy += 1\n  while sy > gy:\n      actions.append(UP)\n      sy -= 1\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
