{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T19:21:34.944087", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  Returns a sequence of actions that will make a stick in the given CraftWorld\n  environment. This simple implementation assumes that the environment is\n  already in a state where the stick can be crafted with a single USE action.\n  It therefore returns a list containing only the USE action.\n  \"\"\"\n  # Action indices as defined by CraftLab.action_specs()\n  USE = 4\n  return [USE]", "env_interactions": 1, "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
