{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T19:21:56.678010", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  # Retrieve the index for the item named \"stick\"\n  try:\n      stick_idx = env.world.cookbook.index[\"stick\"]\n  except Exception:\n      # If the stick item does not exist in the cookbook, return an empty plan\n      return []\n\n  # Get the primitive requirements for one stick (not used further here)\n  _ = env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(stick_idx)\n\n  # Return an empty list of actions (no-op plan)\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
