{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T19:36:35.900904", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  Generate a sequence of actions that makes a ``stick`` in the given environment.\n  This function attempts to use the high-level `craft` helper if available.\n  If not, it falls back to an empty action list.\n\n  Parameters\n  ----------\n  env : object\n      An instance of the Craft environment.\n\n  Returns\n  -------\n  List[int]\n      A list of action indices that, when executed, result in at least one stick.\n  \"\"\"\n  # Use the high\u2011level crafting helper if present.\n  if hasattr(env, \"craft\"):\n      try:\n          return env.craft(\"stick\")\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n  # Fallback: no plan can be generated without additional information.\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T19:36:37.074965", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"Generate a sequence of actions that makes a ``stick`` in the given environment.\n\n  This function attempts to use a high\u2011level ``craft`` helper provided by the\n  environment.  If the helper is unavailable, it falls back to an empty\n  action list.\n  \"\"\"\n  if hasattr(env, \"craft\"):\n      try:\n          return env.craft(\"stick\")\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
