{"timestamp": "2025-10-15T20:24:33.504721", "function_name": "make_stick", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  Returns a sequence of actions that makes a ``stick`` in the given CraftWorld\n  environment.\n\n  The :class:`CraftWorld` environment may expose a ``craft`` method that,\n  given the name of an item, returns a list of action indices which, when\n  executed, will collect the necessary primitives, move to the appropriate\n  workshop and perform the crafting operation.\n\n  If the environment does not provide such a method (or an error occurs)\n  the function falls back to returning an empty list \u2013 a no\u2011op plan.\n  \"\"\"\n  try:\n      # Use the environment's helper to build a valid action sequence.\n      return env.craft('stick')\n  except Exception:\n      # If the helper is unavailable or fails, return an empty (no\u2011op) plan.\n      return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": 0.0}}
